    facts:"DOCUMENTED: Supervisors including BaFin and the FCA have taken action against digital banks over customer due diligence and monitoring deficiencies, including inadequate re-verification and risk reassessment following changes to customer circumstances. INVENTED: the customer, every transfer, all ordering parties, the record changes and the quoted explanation.",
